{"3827360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mini Slayer", "steam_appid": 3827360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outlast the waves. One mistake ends your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini Slayer is a top-down arcade shooter about surviving five minutes of enemy waves to reach the boss alive. It's  harder than it sounds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TWO WAYS TO KILL, TWO REWARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827360/extras/419686d00c0cad50fd0712e44189ec7f.poster.avif?t=1786983839\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827360/extras/419686d00c0cad50fd0712e44189ec7f.webm?t=1786983839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827360/extras/419686d00c0cad50fd0712e44189ec7f.mp4?t=1786983839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch enemies up close for ammo. Shoot them down for gems that level up your speed, damage, and firepower. Going in for the punch is the only way to reload, so every fight is a gamble between safety and survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EASY TO CONTROL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827360/extras/147b88879290e12936feb9d15c93d8c5.poster.avif?t=1786983839\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827360/extras/147b88879290e12936feb9d15c93d8c5.webm?t=1786983839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827360/extras/147b88879290e12936feb9d15c93d8c5.mp4?t=1786983839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash to move, dodge, and punch: all one action. Two weapons, a button each. Auto-aim handles your aim, so every decision is about positioning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN THE WAVES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827360/extras/24fde77293bd0432dcda23df2e56f57b.poster.avif?t=1786983839\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827360/extras/24fde77293bd0432dcda23df2e56f57b.webm?t=1786983839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827360/extras/24fde77293bd0432dcda23df2e56f57b.mp4?t=1786983839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One hit ends your run. The enemies and their timing never change, so every death teaches you the next attempt; but where they surface and which power-ups drop keep you improvising. Reach the boss through skill, not luck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHANGE YOUR LOADOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827360/extras/4145fbf5429a4c4343a6108f7ea1fdc5.poster.avif?t=1786983839\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827360/extras/4145fbf5429a4c4343a6108f7ea1fdc5.webm?t=1786983839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827360/extras/4145fbf5429a4c4343a6108f7ea1fdc5.mp4?t=1786983839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new weapon sets and combat suits: lasers, missiles, swords, shields, extra speed. Each one reshapes how a run plays, so you can find the build that finally gets you to the end.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outlast the waves. One mistake ends your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini Slayer is a top-down arcade shooter about surviving five minutes of enemy waves to reach the boss alive. It's  harder than it sounds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TWO WAYS TO KILL, TWO REWARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827360/extras/419686d00c0cad50fd0712e44189ec7f.poster.avif?t=1786983839\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827360/extras/419686d00c0cad50fd0712e44189ec7f.webm?t=1786983839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827360/extras/419686d00c0cad50fd0712e44189ec7f.mp4?t=1786983839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch enemies up close for ammo. Shoot them down for gems that level up your speed, damage, and firepower. Going in for the punch is the only way to reload, so every fight is a gamble between safety and survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EASY TO CONTROL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827360/extras/147b88879290e12936feb9d15c93d8c5.poster.avif?t=1786983839\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827360/extras/147b88879290e12936feb9d15c93d8c5.webm?t=1786983839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827360/extras/147b88879290e12936feb9d15c93d8c5.mp4?t=1786983839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash to move, dodge, and punch: all one action. Two weapons, a button each. Auto-aim handles your aim, so every decision is about positioning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN THE WAVES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827360/extras/24fde77293bd0432dcda23df2e56f57b.poster.avif?t=1786983839\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827360/extras/24fde77293bd0432dcda23df2e56f57b.webm?t=1786983839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827360/extras/24fde77293bd0432dcda23df2e56f57b.mp4?t=1786983839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One hit ends your run. The enemies and their timing never change, so every death teaches you the next attempt; but where they surface and which power-ups drop keep you improvising. Reach the boss through skill, not luck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHANGE YOUR LOADOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827360/extras/4145fbf5429a4c4343a6108f7ea1fdc5.poster.avif?t=1786983839\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827360/extras/4145fbf5429a4c4343a6108f7ea1fdc5.webm?t=1786983839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827360/extras/4145fbf5429a4c4343a6108f7ea1fdc5.mp4?t=1786983839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new weapon sets and combat suits: lasers, missiles, swords, shields, extra speed. Each one reshapes how a run plays, so you can find the build that finally gets you to the end.</p>", "short_description": "A top-down arcade shooter where one mistake ends the run. Punch enemies for ammo, shoot them for power, and learn the waves well enough to reach the boss.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827360/f5f47b49f7f3d2f7d5e6b23483881b935e85efae/header.jpg?t=1786983839", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827360/4741fa9d0d6f76974e805b3fb8377318763d627f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786983839", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827360/4741fa9d0d6f76974e805b3fb8377318763d627f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786983839", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD FX-6300 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 530 / AMD Radeon R7 240 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Cheese Pull Studio", "Dreamsoft"], "publishers": ["Cheese Pull Studio"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-